# GuardTalkOS — rango (laguna / laguna-kernels) vendor_dlkm modules blocklist.
#
# T-PORT-RANGO-LAYER: REPLACES upstream
# device/google/laguna-kernels/6.6/grapheneos/rango/vendor_dlkm.modules.blocklist
# via BOARD_VENDOR_KERNEL_MODULES_BLOCKLIST_FILE in
# vendor/guardtalk/device/rango/BoardConfig-excised-late.mk.
#
# Baseline: laguna-kernels grapheneos/rango channel (verbatim upstream list,
# .ko suffixes). Do NOT use the tokay/caimito shared blocklist.
#
# GuardTalk addition: blocklist nitrous.ko (BCM BT power/rfkill; present in
# vendor_dlkm.modules.load). WiFi two-phase load (blocklist bcmdhd4390.ko +
# init.insmod.rango.cfg re-modprobe) preserved verbatim from upstream.

